Package: frdpd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, libpam0g, sssd, xserver-xorg-video-dummy, xvfb
Description: FreeRDP-based RDP server with PAM/SSSD/NLA
 This package provides the frdpd daemon, authentication helpers and session
 manager. It supports password-backed NLA (CredSSP) through PAM/SSSD and
 prototype session management.
 .
 Kerberos-first authentication is not installed as a production runtime path.
